    </section>

    <!-- CTA. data-reveal sits on a wrapper, not the element: glint's reveal
         is a WAAPI animation, which composites over author CSS — so on the
         element itself it briefly defeated base.css's :not(:defined) opacity
         guard, fading in the un-upgraded banner and handing it back to the
         guard when the animation ended: visible, invisible, visible. A plain
